<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Central EPS adjusted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Central EPS adjusted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co analyst Steve Lewins said Tuesday he adjusted his first quarter earnings estimate for Illinois Central Corp to $0.50 a share from an earlier estimate range of $0.45 to $0.50.</p>
<p>-- He added the Mississippi River crested in Louisiana without causing damage to Illinois Central's tracks or trains.</p>
<p>-- He rates Illinois Central neutral.</p>
<p>-- Illinois Central shares were up 1/8 at 31-3/4.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
